# Binaries
# Anchored to the repo root. An unanchored `yacht` matches at every depth and
# silently excludes cmd/yacht/, so a fresh clone has no main package to build.
/bin/
/dist/
/yacht

# Go
# Anchored for the same reason: `coverage.*` swallowed docs/coverage.md.
*.test
*.out
/coverage.*

# templ generated files are committed so `go build` works without the templ CLI.
# If you prefer generating in CI instead, uncomment:
# *_templ.go

# Local config / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
